{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿劝告以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，你要归向耶和华—你的 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是因自己的罪孽跌倒了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当归向耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用言语祷告他说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你除净罪孽，悦纳善行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，我们就把嘴唇的祭代替牛犊献上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们不向亚述求救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不骑埃及的马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再对我们手所造的说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我们的 神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为孤儿在你—耶和华那里得蒙怜悯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华应许以色列新生命"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我必医治他们背道的病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甘心爱他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的怒气向他们转消。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向以色列如甘露；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必如百合花开放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如黎巴嫩的树木扎根。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的枝条必延长；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的荣华如橄榄树；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的香气如黎巴嫩的香柏树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾住在他荫下的必归回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发旺如五谷，开花如葡萄树。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的香气如黎巴嫩的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲必说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我与偶像还有什么关涉呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我—耶和华回答他，也必顾念他。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我如青翠的松树；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的果子从我而得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["结束的话"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"谁是智慧人？可以明白这些事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁是通达人？可以知道这一切。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，耶和华的道是正直的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"义人必在其中行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪人却在其上跌倒。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}